'''Water Conservancy (Merciless)''' is the second stage in [[Top of the Bog]]. When clearing this stage, the player is guaranteed to unlock the [[True Form]] of [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]], Cadaver BearCat. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

